# ── Fetched / generated specs — NOT shipped ──────────────────────────────────
# All directories below are produced by `npm run prepare:specs` or individual
# fetch scripts. They contain SAP-proprietary or third-party content that must
# NOT be committed or redistributed. Fetch them locally for your own use.

# SAP DM REST OpenAPI specs (from SAP Business Accelerator Hub, SAP-proprietary)
