# MDO Extractor OData V4 metadata (from your tenant, SAP-proprietary)
docu/sap-dm-mdo-specs/
docu/mdo-extractor-reference.md

# UI5 API metadata (OpenUI5 Apache-2.0 or SAPUI5 proprietary — both git-ignored;
